-- The BECAUSE payload of `#ASSERT REFUSED` must be a STRING literal. A numeric
-- literal parses (so the grammar stays simple) and is rejected here, by the
-- type checker -- mirroring `refuse-nonliteral.l4` for REFUSE's own message.

GIVETH A NUMBER
`nope` MEANS REFUSE "the real reason"

#ASSERT REFUSED `nope` BECAUSE 42
